{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108220","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310822001:0":{"text":"당신들... 당신들은... 듀라 님이시여, 여러분은 정상이군요!","source_cn":"你们……你们……艾雅在上，你们还正常！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97310198B2150B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310822002:0":{"text":"그들은 전부 미쳤어요... 그들... 사악, 사악함이 그들의 마음을 더럽혔습니다!","source_cn":"他们都疯了……他们……邪恶，邪恶污染了他们的内心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC52BB19DDD4D3CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1310822002":{"text":"그들은 전부 미쳤어요... 그들... 사악, 사악함이 그들의 마음을 더럽혔습니다!","source_cn":"他们都疯了……他们……邪恶，邪恶污染了他们的内心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC52BB19DDD4D3CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310822003:0":{"text":"침착... 침착해야 해요... 저, 전...","source_cn":"冷静……我要冷静……我、我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70346F95A6AB5F63","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"침착... 침착해야 해요... 저, 전...","female":"침착... 침착해야 해요... 저, 전...","variant_male_record_index":"145317","variant_female_record_index":"145318","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310822005:1":{"text":"무슨 일인데?","source_cn":"发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944B535BD067270C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310822006:0":{"text":"다, 당신은... 살아있는 시체?! 으아...!","source_cn":"你、你……活死人？！啊——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9E11FEF7285738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310822007:1":{"text":"두려워하지 마세요! 발리카는 당신을 해치지 않아요. 저희를 보세요, 저희도 아무렇지 않잖아요!","source_cn":"不要怕！瓦丽卡不会伤害你的，你看我们一点事都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90B4C751A4E65DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310822008:1":{"text":"부디 침착하고, 천천히 얘기해 보세요. 대체 무슨 일이 일어난 거죠?","source_cn":"请冷静一下，慢慢说，到底发生什么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE971A6DDAAD70AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310822009:1":{"text":"위... 위쪽... 작은 성당에... 몬스터가! 사악한 몬스터가! 분명 몬스터가 그 형제자매의 마음을 더럽혔을 거예요! 그들은 미쳐버렸어요!","source_cn":"上……上面……小教堂……怪物！邪恶的怪物！一定是怪物玷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE088396D97F07075","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310822010:0":{"text":"음... 작은 성당... 몬스터요? 당신이 무슨 말을 하는지 잘 모르겠어요. 그냥 저희를 그쪽으로 데려다 주세요.","source_cn":"呃……小教堂……怪物？看起来你也说不清楚，干脆你带我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C837EE43C4E79BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_re